{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hexalith</strong> is a strategic sci-fi city-builder where you expand a glowing hex-grid colony by placing resource and city tiles. Plan your layout, complete missions, and aim for the highest score\u2014each run offering a new path to optimize and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/MainMenuRotationGif.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Start With Your Robotic Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the beginning of every run, you choose one of three carriers\u2014robotic pets that construct your buildings and grant your first city blueprint. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/CarrierSelection2.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each carrier introduces a different starting setup and tactical angle so choose wisely based on the main mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/CarrierSelection1.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Place Resources, Build Cities, Complete Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your colony using resource tiles, gradually unlocking the ability to place city-tiles. Cities generate Civilization - Civ Points, helping you fulfill main and bonus missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/PlacingResourcesAndCity.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smart tile placement matters. There are 13 unique city-tiles currently in the game, each with their own adjacency effects that reward thoughtful planning and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/CityRotation2Gif.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Main missions grant new city blueprints upon completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side missions offer score boosts or extra resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/Missions.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failing a main mission ends the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/GameOver.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use the Shop to Evolve Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between turns, you gather resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/ResourceSelling.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 5 turns, the shop refreshes, allowing you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new city blueprints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase one-time-use tiles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/ShopBuyBPS.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop wisely to unlock stronger city placements and push your score even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 3 unique robotic carriers to start each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match 3 different resource tiles to unlock and construct city-tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build up to 13 distinct city-tiles, each with adjacency bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete main missions to keep progressing, or start fresh on failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn rewards from optional side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic shop system that refreshes every 5 turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score-focused gameplay with high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neon-eco sci-fi aesthetic with glowing hexes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Planned Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meta-progression system to unlock upgrades and features across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboards for competitive high score play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New cities and mission types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable cosmetics and visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Events and vertical upgrading of cities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683050?t=1750493244","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683050?t=1750493244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/d730911b0476aa01114d0fb6a0e747bc000708e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750493244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/d730911b0476aa01114d0fb6a0e747bc000708e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750493244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hexalith</strong> is a strategic sci-fi city-builder where you expand a glowing hex-grid colony by placing resource and city tiles. Plan your layout, complete missions, and aim for the highest score\u2014each run offering a new path to optimize and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/MainMenuRotationGif.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Start With Your Robotic Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the beginning of every run, you choose one of three carriers\u2014robotic pets that construct your buildings and grant your first city blueprint. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/CarrierSelection2.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each carrier introduces a different starting setup and tactical angle so choose wisely based on the main mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/CarrierSelection1.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Place Resources, Build Cities, Complete Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your colony using resource tiles, gradually unlocking the ability to place city-tiles. Cities generate Civilization - Civ Points, helping you fulfill main and bonus missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/PlacingResourcesAndCity.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smart tile placement matters. There are 13 unique city-tiles currently in the game, each with their own adjacency effects that reward thoughtful planning and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/CityRotation2Gif.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Main missions grant new city blueprints upon completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side missions offer score boosts or extra resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/Missions.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failing a main mission ends the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/GameOver.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use the Shop to Evolve Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between turns, you gather resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/ResourceSelling.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 5 turns, the shop refreshes, allowing you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new city blueprints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase one-time-use tiles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/ShopBuyBPS.gif?t=1750493244\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop wisely to unlock stronger city placements and push your score even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 3 unique robotic carriers to start each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match 3 different resource tiles to unlock and construct city-tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build up to 13 distinct city-tiles, each with adjacency bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete main missions to keep progressing, or start fresh on failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn rewards from optional side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic shop system that refreshes every 5 turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score-focused gameplay with high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neon-eco sci-fi aesthetic with glowing hexes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Planned Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meta-progression system to unlock upgrades and features across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboards for competitive high score play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New cities and mission types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable cosmetics and visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Events and vertical upgrading of cities</p></li></ul>","developers":["Artemi Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/fd464a26891d1a68a2c46b8432c3717a6517797a/header.jpg?t=1750493244","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":t